  "title": "Unbelievable Rolls",
  "description": "Make these unbelievably fluffy, tender dinner rolls from standard ingredients. The unorthodox method and a lidded plastic bowl simplify the process.",
  "authors": [
    "SHERLIE"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-06-08T18:32:00-04:00",
